{"id":"555425","name":"煎炸葱油饼","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/555425/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"50克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"6克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"11克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"8克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"400克"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"2克"},{"name":"油","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把面粉、糯米粉、酵母粉、泡打粉，盐、糖，温水混合，和成较软的面团，盖上保鲜膜醒30分钟。","img":"images/555425/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入香葱、十三香和10克油。","img":"images/555425/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"和匀。","img":"images/555425/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵至2倍大。","img":"images/555425/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"晶盾不锈钢煎锅中放入适量油，把醒好的面团直接从盆里取一块，用手摁成圆饼放入锅中。","img":"images/555425/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎炸至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/555425/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/555425/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/555425/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/555425/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}